  "¿Puedo ver y probar el Mazda {0} {1} Sportive?": ["Puc veure i provar el Mazda {0} {1} Sportive?","Can I see and test-drive the Mazda {0} {1} Sportive?"],
  "Sí. Pide cita en esta página eligiendo día y hora y te lo tenemos preparado en Sabadell. Atendemos de lunes a viernes de {0}:{1} a {2}:{3} y los sábados de {4}:{5} a {6}:{7}.": ["Sí. Demana cita en aquesta pàgina triant dia i hora i te'l tenim preparat a Sabadell. Atenem de dilluns a divendres de {0}:{1} a {2}:{3} i els dissabtes de {4}:{5} a {6}:{7}.","Yes. Book a visit on this page by choosing a day and time and we'll have it ready for you in Sabadell. We're open Monday to Friday from {0}:{1} to {2}:{3} and on Saturdays from {4}:{5} to {6}:{7}."],
  "¿El Mazda {0} tiene garantía?": ["El Mazda {0} té garantia?","Does the Mazda {0} come with a warranty?"],
